{"id":10659,"artist":"IN YOUR EYES (1983) <<<","title":">>> GEORGE BENSON","lyrics_plain":"I think I finally know you\nI can see beyond your smile\nI think that I can show you\nThat what we have is still worthwhile\nDon't you know that love's just like the thread\nThat keeps unravelling\nBut then it ties us back together in the end\nIn your eyes, I can see my dream's reflections\nIn your eyes, found the answer to my questions\nIn your eyes, I can see the reasons why our love's alive\nIn your eyes\nWe're drifting safely back to shore\nAnd I think I've finally learned to love you more\nYou warned me that live changes\nThat no one really knows\nWhether time would make us strangers\nOr whether time would make us grow\nEven though the winds of time will change\nIn a world where nothing stays the same\nThrough it all our love will still remain\nIn your eyes, I can see my dream's reflections\nIn your eyes, found the answer to my questions\nIn your eyes, I can see the reasons why our love's alive\nIn your eyes\nWe're drifting safely back to shore\nAnd I think I've finally learned to love you more\nIn your eyes, I can see the reasons why our love's alive\nYou and I, we're drifting safely back to shore\nAnd I think I've finally learned to love you more","lyrics_synced":"[00:17.20] I think I finally know you\n[00:20.59] I can see beyond your smile\n[00:23.54] I think that I can show you\n[00:26.75] That what we have is still worthwhile\n[00:30.02] Don't you know that love's just like the thread\n[00:33.82] That keeps unravelling\n[00:37.68] But then it ties us back together in the end\n[00:43.70] In your eyes, I can see my dream's reflections\n[00:50.87] In your eyes, found the answer to my questions\n[00:57.79] In your eyes, I can see the reasons why our love's alive\n[01:07.71] In your eyes\n[01:11.07] We're drifting safely back to shore\n[01:14.95] And I think I've finally learned to love you more\n[01:25.76] You warned me that live changes\n[01:28.64] That no one really kn